{"title": "Nepalese mountaineer Nirmal Purja dies in avalanche on Broad Peak", "summary": "Veteran Nepalese mountaineer Nirmal Purja died in an avalanche on Broad Peak in Pakistan's PoK region, days after the mountain experienced a major avalanche. The incident occurred on February 11, 2023. Nirmal Purja was 45 years old. He had set multiple records for climbing the world's highest peaks. The bodies of nine other climbers were recovered from the site. The cause of the avalanche is under investigation.", "summary_points": ["Nirmal Purja died in an avalanche on Broad Peak in Pakistan's PoK region on February 11, 2023.", "He was 45 years old and had set multiple records for climbing the world's highest peaks.", "The bodies of nine other climbers were recovered from the site.", "The cause of the avalanche is under investigation."], "title_hi": "नेपाली पर्वतारोही निर्मल पुर्जा ब्रोड पीक पर गिरावट में मरे", "summary_hi": "नेपाली पर्वतारोही निर्मल पुर्जा ब्रोड पीक पर गिरावट में मरे । यह घटना 11 फरवरी, 2023 को हुई थी। उन्हें 45 साल का माना जाता है। उन्होंने दुनिया की सबसे ऊंची चोटियों को चढ़ाने के लिए कई रिकॉर्ड बनाए। गिरावट के स्थल पर नौ अन्य पर्वतारोहियों के शरीर प्राप्त हुए। इस घटना की जांच शुरू है।", "summary_points_hi": ["निर्मल पुर्जा ब्रोड पीक पर गिरावट में मरे । 11 फरवरी, 2023 को यह घटना हुई थी।", "उन्हें 45 साल का माना जाता है। उन्होंने दुनिया की सबसे ऊंची चोटियों को चढ़ाने के लिए कई रिकॉर्ड बनाए।", "गिरावट के स्थल पर नौ अन्य पर्वतारोहियों के शरीर प्राप्त हुए।", "इस घटना की जांच शुरू है।"], "framing": {"left": ["Left-leaning outlets foregrounded the avalanche's impact on the climbing community, highlighting Nirmal Purja's achievements and the risks faced by climbers. They cited his record-breaking expeditions and the challenges of climbing in high-altitude regions."], "center": ["Centrist coverage reported the incident as a tragic accident, focusing on the recovery efforts and the investigation into the cause of the avalanche. They mentioned Nirmal Purja's achievements but did not dwell on them."], "right": ["Right-leaning outlets framed the story around Nirmal Purja's life and background, highlighting his military service and his 'Project Possible' expedition. They emphasized his record-breaking accomplishments and portrayed him as a hero."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["नेपाली पर्वतारोही निर्मल पुर्जा के लिए गिरावट का प्रभाव, उनके उपलब्धियों और चोटियों पर चढ़ने वाले लोगों द्वारा जोखिम को उजागर करते हुए। उन्होंने कई रिकॉर्ड बनाए थे और उच्च ऊंचाई वाले क्षेत्रों में चढ़ाई करने की चुनौतियों पर जोर दिया।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.opindia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/HLpF0RVbgAAKuXm-768x497.jpeg", "sources": [{"source": "Al Jazeera English", "owner": "Al Jazeera English", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Famed climber Purja confirmed dead as bodies recovered from Broad Peak"}, {"source": "France 24", "owner": "France 24", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPd2QzaUNyLUI1SXh3VEFicERfNWk4MDYwQ2tQUkRUY2tSdVlHWTlWbmNRYXlPNlNjNVRxTHQtcEpBdXR0bkFCUExZVEg0dWF5Y2ZPVUJXZzlrYmZaYkN3aEZiWlRQSjJteDhWNVc1ZzdfY3RpUGVuZVBSZTQ4UzBhNmpVc2g2cDU3SW80VGZnX2NIZDBmWXFUU25yMFhKY01VU0lhUDlSSWt2Sm4zMHN4cFVaSzVkOHlw?oc=5", "headline": "Famed climber Nirmal Purja, nine others die in avalanche in Pakistan"}, {"source": "OpIndia", "owner": "OpIndia", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.opindia.com/2026/08/who-was-nirmal-nimsdai-purja-gurkha-soldier-who-redefined-modern-mountaineering-death-broad-peak-avalanche", "headline": "Who was Nirmal Purja? The British-Nepali mountaineer who conquered all 14 highest peaks in record time"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "owner": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Veteran Nepalese mountaineer Nirmal Purja dies in avalanche on Broad Peak in PoK: Report